<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">gold-helm</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A helm of gold, against iron: protection x0.6, weight x1.5. +2 Charisma.
Gold is soft and heavy and a poor thing to fight with, and worth a small
fortune: wealth worn openly.

